# Phase 11b — Assistant record tools

**Branch:** `phase-11b-assistant-tools`

## Goal

OpenAI tool loop can search/read TaskMesh records and propose document/idea/task updates; UI confirms before PATCH.

## Exit criteria

- Tools: `search_records`, `get_entity`, `list_project_context`, `propose_document_update`, `propose_idea_update`, `propose_task_update`
- SSE events: `tool`, `proposal`, `delta`, `done`, `error`
- ConfirmDialog apply via existing REST; invalidate React Query keys
- Client-side transcript persistence (localStorage) for refresh on same browser

## Non-goals

fetch_url (11c), Anthropic, server-side thread DB (can follow later).
